#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/allocations.rst:109
msgid "Lease Timeout Behavior"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/allocations.rst:111
msgid ""
"The lease timeout controls when allocations are released after user "
"disconnect:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/allocations.rst:113
msgid ""
"**Non-persistent pools:** Recommended timeout of ~10 minutes. After "
"expiry, the VM is destroyed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/allocations.rst:114
msgid ""
"**Persistent pools:** Recommended timeout of ~1 hour. After expiry, the "
"VM is shut down."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/allocations.rst:116
msgid "Important"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/allocations.rst:116
msgid ""
"Lease timeouts auto-extend for as long as the user is logged into or "
"browsing any area of the |morpheus| application. Once the user closes "
"their browser or logs out, timeouts stop auto-extending."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/allocations.rst:119
msgid "Pool Sizing and Allocations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/allocations.rst:121
msgid "Allocations interact with pool sizing parameters:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/allocations.rst:123
msgid ""
"**Minimum Idle** — Minimum number of available (unassigned) allocations "
"to maintain. |morpheus| proactively provisions instances to meet this "
"threshold."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/allocations.rst:124
msgid ""
"**Initial Pool Size** — Number of instances provisioned when the pool is "
"created."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/allocations.rst:125
msgid ""
"**Maximum Pool Size** — Hard cap on total allocations (reserved + "
"available)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/vdi/allocations.rst:127
msgid ""
"When an allocation is released (non-persistent), the pool controller "
"checks if the available count has dropped below the minimum idle "
"threshold and provisions replacements."
msgstr ""

